title: Wire PostToolUse after tool completion
updated_at: "2026-08-02T04:22:52Z"
---
After each tool call completes successfully, fire PostToolUse with tool_name, tool_input, and tool_response. Hook stdout/additionalContext is added to agent context. Non-blocking (cannot undo execution).